      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After speaking to a vast number of installers during my initial investigations, the overall experience I had with Clear Cut was fantastic. Lisa was very transparent and communicative when assessing my requirements and the systems on offer. She spent the time to break-down the quote and what would be involved. Further, the fact that its a family owned and operated business with clear emphasis on client satisfaction and strong interpersonal values really sold it for me.After deciding to go with Clear Cut, they sent around a team member for a pre-installation inspection to confirm everything was acceptable and to identify & mitigate any potential install issues. Again, this was a great experience as he talked me through the installation requirements and what would be involved.The install team arrived a few weeks later and were very professional & pleasant to deal with. They kept me updated with arrival times, installation progress, next steps, etc and provided a through handover on completion including all safety aspects.Overall, it was an amazing experience with Lisa, Nik and the team. I would absolutely recommend and encourage those on the fence to consider Clear Cut.",
